WEBVTT

00:07:27.042 --> 00:07:30.268
struggling and working
for the betterment of their communities

00:07:30.292 --> 00:07:32.000
were threatened and targeted.

00:07:34.375 --> 00:07:36.393
Even I had to leave,

00:07:36.417 --> 00:07:38.708
leaving my children
behind with my in-laws.

00:07:42.917 --> 00:07:48.018
I closed my office in Dir
and relocated to Peshawar,

00:07:48.042 --> 00:07:49.542
the capital of my province.

00:07:51.083 --> 00:07:54.875
I was in trauma,
kept thinking what to do next.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:08:01.518
And most of the family members and friends